WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:11.000
Image-filled world orbs float in a bright, patterned constellation.
Controller hints show how to place and enter an idea.

00:11.000 --> 00:32.000
Inside the Great Wall, a listening pane becomes a question and answer.
A nearby orb leads to the connected watchtower.

00:32.000 --> 00:45.000
Inside the brick watchtower, arched windows look out onto the landscape.
A travel orb connects back to the Great Wall exterior.

00:45.000 --> 00:58.000
A blue portal transition leads into the biology lab.
DNA and RNA models float beside a movable explanation pane.

00:58.000 --> 01:17.000
The pane shows a request to create a ribosome.
A new ribosome model and its explanation appear in the lab.

01:17.000 --> 01:31.000
Back in the constellation, world orbs have previews and descriptions.
Their connections can be selected and changed.
